Format references
  PKWARE APPNOTE.TXT 6.3.10 — ZIP format specification (section 4.3 records,
  4.4.5 compression methods, 4.4.7 CRC-32, 4.5.3 ZIP64 extra field).
  RFC 1951 — DEFLATE. RFC 1952 — GZIP (CRC-32/ISO-HDLC check value 0xCBF43926).
  These are specifications, not code; no code was copied from them.

